[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0613","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0613.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1495","title":"Rudi Benkovic JAWMail 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-1495是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1495"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:26Z","remediation":"升级到 Rudi Benkovic JAWmail 的最新稳定版本（≥1.0.1），并立即应用针对 XSS 漏洞的补丁；同时为电子邮件系统实施内容安全策略（CSP）头部验证，强制对所有 HTML 内容进行严格的字符集和标签过滤；在邮件预览功能中禁用动态脚本执行；实施文件名字符集白名单验证，仅允许安全字符并过滤所有HTML特殊字符；最后启用浏览器X-XSS-Protection防护并配置安全的XSS审计日志记录以持续监控潜在攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0270.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10152.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5771","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21817","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1495.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1495","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1495.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1495.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1495.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1ce9765ce7bccd5f940cdb53e9ce6846944cee75/2002/CVE-2002-1495.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8aab22d02785f79271894073fc1a1d558c4aae6b/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1495.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1495.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1495.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1495.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0613.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0613.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0613.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0612","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0612.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1494","title":"Aestiva HTML/OS 2.4 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Aestiva HTML/OS 2.4 版本存在跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可在 URL 末尾追加斜杠字符并插入任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本代码，当用户访问该恶意构造的链接时，应用程序会将未经过滤的脚本内容回显至错误消息页面中，导致脚本在用户浏览器端执行。攻击者借此可窃取用户会话 Cookie、重定向至恶意网站或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞影响范围覆盖运行 Aestiva HTML/OS 2.4 的 Web 服务器，攻击无需认证即可远程触发，攻击复杂度中等，主要依赖社会工程诱骗用户点击特制链接即可完成利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1494"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 Aestiva HTML/OS 至官方发布的最新版本（高于 2.4），并在应用程序代码中对错误消息页面输出的用户输入内容进行 HTML 实体编码。如暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器或代理层部署过滤规则，拦截包含 `<script>`、`javascript:` 等特征的请求，同时对 URL 参数实施输入验证，限制斜杠（/）后直接拼接脚本内容的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0026.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10029.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5618","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21769","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1494.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1494.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1494","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1494.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1494.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f71e6da69aa54c2303f943ea4b05f52ce2f911ff/2002/CVE-2002-1494.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1494.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/79f011994331b34296ba6ea2a2efb2abebb8b5f6/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1494.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1494.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1494.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0612.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0612.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0612.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0611","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0611.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1493","title":"Lycos HTMLGear 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Lycos HTMLGear guestbook 留言簿组件存在跨站脚本（XSS）注入漏洞。攻击者可在提交的留言内容中，通过 IMG 标签的 SRC 属性或 STYLE 样式属性注入恶意脚本代码，当其他用户访问包含恶意内容的留言页面时，脚本将在受害者浏览器中执行，从而窃取 Cookie、会话令牌或重定向用户至恶意站点。该漏洞影响所有部署了 Lycos HTMLGear guestbook 功能的网站及其访问用户，攻击者无需身份认证即可提交恶意留言触发漏洞利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1493"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:25Z","remediation":"Lycos HTMLGear guestGear 组件已停止维护多年，无法通过升级修复此漏洞。建议立即从服务中移除 guestGear 聊天簿组件并替换为受支持的现代替代方案；若短期内无法下线，应在 Web 服务器前端部署 WAF 规则，严格过滤输入中的 STYLE 属性及 IMG SRC 字段，阻断类似 javascript: 和 expression() 等脚本注入载荷，以降低跨站脚本攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0198.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0132.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5728","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/12235","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21802","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1493.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1493.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1493","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1493.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1493.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f71e6da69aa54c2303f943ea4b05f52ce2f911ff/2002/CVE-2002-1493.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/709d7a1077875b40fcef6c8e7b7d04e5c3506666/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1493.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1493.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1493.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1493.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0611.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0611.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0611.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0610","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0610.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1492","title":"Cisco VPN 5000 Client 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cisco VPN 5000 Client 在 Linux 平台 5.2.7 及之前版本、Solaris 平台 5.2.8 及之前版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于 close_tunnel 和 open_tunnel 功能对输入数据长度校验不足，本地低权限用户可通过向这两个函数传入超长参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而获得系统 root 权限。攻击者需在目标主机上拥有本地登录权限，利用该漏洞可完全控制受影响系统，执行任意代码、篡改数据或发起进一步内网攻击。Cisco 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，受影响用户应升级到 5.2.7（Linux）或 5.2.8（Solaris）及以上版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1492"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:25Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 平台 Cisco VPN 5000 Client 升级至 5.2.7 及以上版本，将 Solaris 平台升级至 5.2.8 及以上版本。可从 Cisco 官方支持站点下载对应补丁并替换旧版客户端程序。如暂无法立即升级，应限制本地用户对 VPN 5000 Client 安装目录的写权限，并监控系统日志中 open_tunnel 与 close_tunnel 的异常调用记录，防止本地提权利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/vpn5k-client-multiple-vuln-pub.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10131.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5734","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21806","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1492.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1492.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1492.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1492","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1492.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1492.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1492.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1492.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f89e5c809343acea555b12ff38461dcb4bd93eb9/2002/CVE-2002-1492.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/22b1a4be43e1ee76195d2510f5edf079a15013bd/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1492.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0610.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0609","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1489","title":"PlanetDNS PlanetWeb HTTP GET 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"标签包裹。<value>PlanetDNS PlanetWeb 1.14 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标服务器发送包含超长 URL 的 HTTP GET 请求或使用超长方法名称的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用后可执行任意代码，导致服务器被完全控制。该漏洞利用复杂度低，攻击者仅需通过网络发送特制请求即可完成攻击，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性均造成严重影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1489"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:25Z","remediation":"PlanetDNS 已于多年前停止维护，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即将 PlanetWeb 替换为仍在维护的开源 Web 服务器（如 Nginx、Apache HTTP Server 或 Caddy），并配置请求行长度限制（如 Nginx 设置 large_client_header_buffers 4 16K，Apache 设置 LimitRequestFieldSize 和 LimitRequestLine），以阻止过长 URL 或方法名触发缓冲区溢出。在完成替换前，可在前端部署 WAF 或反向代理，对 HTTP 请求行长度进行严格校验并丢弃超长请求，同时限制该服务器的网络访问范围为仅允许可信源 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0166.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0236.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10124.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10391.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5710","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21795","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1489.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1489.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1489","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1489.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1489.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2002/CVE-2002-1489.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d04c47fa1c5351dcfc0e5326362cbbabb6ce30da/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1489.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1489.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1489.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2002-1489.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0609.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0609.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0608","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1488","title":"Cerulean Studios Trillian 0.74 IRC 客户端拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trillian 0.73 和 0.74 版本的 IRC 组件在处理用户离开频道的 PART 消息时存在逻辑缺陷。当消息中未指定频道名称，或指定的频道并非用户当前所在的频道时，客户端会因异常处理不当而崩溃。远程攻击者仅需控制一个恶意 IRC 服务器，待 Trillian 用户连接后发送特制 PART 消息即可触发拒绝服务，攻击无需身份认证且条件简单。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1488"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:25Z","remediation":"建议升级 Trillian 到 0.75 或更高版本（官方已修复该 IRC PART 消息解析缺陷），下载地址：https://www.trillian.im/get/。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面阻断非受信 IRC 服务器的连接，或在 Trillian 设置中禁用 IRC 协议支持作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0268.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10162.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5776","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21821","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1488.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1488.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1488","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1488.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1488.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2002/CVE-2002-1488.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1488.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8520d937e15944966a691fee8c5449a66b3b22b2/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1488.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1488.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1488.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0607","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0607.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1487","title":"Cerulean Studios Trillian 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trillian 0.73 和 0.74 版本的 IRC 组件存在远程拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过搭建恶意 IRC 服务器，当用户使用受影响版本的 Trillian 客户端连接到该服务器时，服务器向客户端发送特制的原始 IRC 消息（包括 206、211、213、214、215、217、218、243、302、317、324、332、333、352、367 等命令），触发客户端在解析这些消息时发生异常，导致程序崩溃。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击条件简单，只要目标用户连接到恶意 IRC 服务器即可触发。利用方式为远程拒绝服务攻击，攻击者可借此中断受影响用户的即时通讯服务。受影响产品为 Cerulean Studios 开发的 Trillian 0.73 和 0.74 版本 IRC 客户端。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1487"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:25Z","remediation":"升级到 Trillian 0.74d 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。Cerulean Studios 发布的 0.74d 补丁修复了 IRC 组件对原始消息 206、211、213、214、215、217、218、243、302、317、324、332、333、352 和 367 的异常处理缺陷。如暂时无法升级，建议避免连接不受信任的 IRC 服务器，或临时更换其他即时通讯客户端作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0268.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10161.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5775","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/73","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1487.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1487.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1487","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1487.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1487.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2002/CVE-2002-1487.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1487.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1487.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1487.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1487.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0607.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0606","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1486","title":"Trillian IRC 组件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-1486是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1486"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 Trillian 到最新安全版本（5.x 系列）。访问官方网站下载最新版或通过软件内置更新检查功能自动更新。如果需要临时缓解措施，可在防火墙中阻止IRC端口（默认6667）或限制Trillian的IRC功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0258.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0266.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0268.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2002-q3/0139.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2002-q3/0140.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10150.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10151.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10163.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5765","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5769","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5777","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21810","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1486.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1486","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1486.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1486.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1486.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2002/CVE-2002-1486.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1486.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1486.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1486.json","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2002-1486.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0068","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1337","title":"Sendmail 头处理缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sendmail 邮件传输代理存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，影响 5.79 至 8.12.7 版本。该漏洞源于 headers.c 文件中 crackaddr 函数在处理发件人与收件人头部注释字段时，未对格式化地址进行边界校验，导致缓冲区溢出。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含特制格式化地址字段的邮件，触发该缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意代码。由于该漏洞位于核心邮件处理路径，且攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用，因此可被远程攻击者完全控制易受攻击的 Sendmail 服务器，造成极其严重的危害。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1337"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-03-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:07Z","remediation":"立即将 Sendmail 升级至 8.12.8 或更高版本以修复 headers.c 中 crackaddr() 函数的缓冲区溢出漏洞。从 5.79 至 8.12.7 的所有版本均受影响，升级前请先从 https://www.sendmail.org 下载最新稳定版源码并重新编译安装。如无法立即升级，可在 sendmail.cf 配置文件中设置 `O PrivacyOptions=restrictqrun` 以限制队列访问，或在防火墙层对 SMTP 端口 25 的入站连接实施严格的源 IP 白名单过滤，同时限制外部主机通过 SMTP 提交过长或包含特殊格式的邮件头字段，以临时降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000571","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:028","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104673778105192&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104678739608479&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104678862109841&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104678862409849&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104679411316818&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY40500&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY40501&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY40502&apar=only","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2003-07.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-257","http://www.iss.net/issEn/delivery/xforce/