rver Cookie可预测认证绕过漏洞","description":"TightVNC 3.3.3r2-21 之前版本的 vncserver 包装脚本在生成认证 Cookie 时调用 rand() 函数前未调用 srand() 进行种子初始化，导致每次生成的随机数序列完全可预测。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过多次连接观察或直接计算预测 VNC 会话的认证 Cookie，从而绕过 VNC 服务器的身份验证机制，获得对目标系统的未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响所有使用该版本 vncserver 包装脚本的 VNC 部署，攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1511"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:27Z","remediation":"升级 VNC 至 3.3.3r2-21 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:041 或 RHSA-2003:068 提供的更新包；Debian 用户升级至 3.3.6-3；Gentoo 用户应用 GLSA 200302-15；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:022。临时缓解措施可在 VNC 服务端配置中限制仅允许本地回环地址连接，或使用 SSH 隧道封装 VNC 流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://changelogs.credativ.org/debian/pool/main/v/vnc/vnc_3.3.6-3/changelog","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000640","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-200302-15.xml","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert/56161","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11384.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:022","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-041.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-068.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6905","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1511.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1511","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1511.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1511.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2002/CVE-2002-1511.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1511.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1511.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1511.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1511.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-15xx/CVE-2002-1511.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0396","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0396.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1510","title":"XFree86 xdm authDir 缺失导致未授权连接漏洞","description":"xdm（X Display Manager）在 authComplain 变量设置为 false 且认证目录不存在时，不会向用户发出警告，而是直接允许任意远程攻击者无需认证即可连接到 X 服务器，从而获取对目标系统图形界面的完全控制权限。攻击者无需任何身份凭证即可利用此漏洞，危害等级严重，CVSS 评分 10.0。受影响的包括 XFree86 4.1.0 及早期版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1510"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:27Z","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.2.0 或更高版本（NetBSD 对应更新 xsrc/xfree86），或安装 Red Hat 提供的 RHSA-2003:064/RHSA-2003:065 安全更新。如无法升级，确保 xdm 认证目录（通常为 /var/lib/xdm/authdir）存在且权限正确，并将 xdm 配置中 authComplain 设为 true 以拒绝未认证连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000533","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert/55602","http://wuarchive.wustl.edu/mirrors/NetBSD/NetBSD-current/xsrc/xfree/xc/programs/Xserver/hw/xfree86/CHANGELOG","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11389.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-064.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-065.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1510.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1510.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1510","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1510.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1510.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2002/CVE-2002-1510.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1510.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-15xx/CVE-2002-1510.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1510.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1510.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0396.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0393","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0393.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1509","title":"RedHat shadow-utils useradd 邮箱存储文件权限设置漏洞","description":"shadow-utils 20000902 版本的补丁导致 useradd 命令在创建用户邮箱存储文件时，将文件权限设置为 660（属主和同组用户均可读写），而非更安全的权限模式。本地攻击者只需与目标用户处于同一用户组，即可读取或修改该用户的 incoming 邮件，导致敏感信息泄露或邮件内容被篡改。该漏洞影响 RedHat 等使用 shadow-utils 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低，利用条件要求攻击者已拥有本地账户且与目标用户同组。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1509"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:27Z","remediation":"立即升级 shadow-utils 到修复版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:057/RHSA-2003:058 提供的更新包，Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:026 更新。如无法升级，手动将 /var/spool/mail 目录下新建用户的邮箱文件权限改为 600（仅所有者可读写），或在 useradd 后通过脚本执行 chmod 600 /var/spool/mail/$USER 修正权限。","status"