境变量，使其指向包含恶意代码的共享库模块，从而在程序运行时被加载执行，实现本地权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响 XFree86 系列版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1472"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 XFree86 至修复版本：Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2003-066 提供的更新包，Red Hat 7.x/8.x 用户安装 RHSA-2003-067 提供的更新包；SuSE Linux 用户安装 SuSE 2002 年 9 月安全公告中提供的 xfree86 更新。临时缓解措施：在 setuid/setgid 程序执行前清除 LD_PRELOAD 环境变量，或通过 /etc/ld.so.preload 白名单机制限制动态库加载路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2002-q3/1116.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000529","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10137.php","http://www.osvdb.org/11922","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-066.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-067.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5735","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1472.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1472","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1472.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1472.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3e2d7833ca42f41a6bb2e84d7adeb5471252536d/2002/CVE-2002-1472.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1472.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1472.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1472.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1472.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1472.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0390.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0391","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0391.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1508","title":"OpenLDAP slapd 本地竞态条件任意文件写入漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 2.2.0 及更早版本中的 slapd 守护进程在处理被拒绝的复制请求时，创建日志文件存在条件竞争漏洞。具有本地系统访问权限的攻击者可通过操纵文件创建与写入的时间窗口，利用该竞态条件覆盖系统上任意文件，导致本地文件完整性受损。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要攻击者具备本地用户权限且精确控制时间窗口，CVSS 评分仅 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1508"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:27Z","remediation":"升级 OpenLDAP 至 2.2.0 以上版本。Debian 用户安装 openldap2 2.0.0-5 及以上版本（DSA-227）；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:040 提供的更新包；SuSE 用户应用 advisory 2002_047_openldap2 补丁。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 slapd 日志目录的写入权限，并禁用复制日志功能（replication logging）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-227","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11288.php","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:006","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_047_openldap2.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-040.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1508.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1508.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1508","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1508.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1508.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3e2d7833ca42f41a6bb2e84d7adeb5471252536d/2002/CVE-2002-1508.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1508.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-15xx/CVE-2002-1508.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1508.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1508.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0391.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0308","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1160","title":"Linux PAM pam_xauth 模块本地权限提升漏洞","description":"pam_xauth 是 Linux PAM（可插拔认证模块）中用于在用户切换（su/sudo）时保持 X 窗口会话认证信息的模块。该模块默认配置会将 MIT-Magic-Cookie 转发至新的 X 会话，当 root 用户使用 su 命令切换用户时，pam_xauth 会使用原始用户的凭据创建一个临时 .xauth 文件。本地低权限攻击者可通过竞态条件或目录权限不当读取该临时 .xauth 文件，窃取其中存储的 MIT-Magic-Cookie，进而冒充原用户连接 X 显示服务器，最终实现向 root 权限的提权。该漏洞影响使用 PAM pam_xauth 模块且采用默认行为的 Linux/Unix 系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1160"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 pam 软件包至 RHSA-2003:028  advisory 修复版本（Red Hat Enterprise Linux AS/WS 平台），该版本为 pam_xauth 模块添加了 ACL 访问控制功能并默认禁止 root 转发 cookie。具体操作：运行 `rpm -Uvh pam-*.rpm` 安装更新包，随后编辑 `/etc/pam.d/su` 或 `/etc/pam.d/sudo` 文件，在 pam_xauth 调用行添加 `noxauth` 参数或注释掉该行以禁用 cookie 转发。作为临时缓解措施，执行 `chmod 600 ~/.xauth` 限制 .xauth 文件权限，确保仅文件所有者可读写，防止本地用户窃取 MIT-Magic-Cookie 提升为 root。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000693","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104431622818954&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/